      "claim": "The fluorobenzamide [18F]2-FBP showed good brain uptake in mice, supporting that the fluorophenyl amide/vinylogous amide motif present in the query is compatible with BBB penetration.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    },
    {
      "card_ids": ["C08"],
      "claim": "A fluorobenzamide-derived anilide accumulated in multiple rat brain regions on PET-CT-MRI, providing direct evidence that the fluorophenyl anilide class to which the query belongs can achieve meaningful CNS exposure.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    },
    {
      "card_ids": ["C11"],
      "claim": "The fluorobenzamide anilide EFB-1 was detected in rat brain after IV administration, confirming moderate BBB crossing for this structural family and supporting meaningful, if not maximal, CNS access for the query.",
