  "decision_summary": "The query is a lipophilic cinnamoyl-fluorophenyl anilide with a pyrazole-cinnamyl group. Multiple close structural analogs—α,β-unsaturated aryl carbonyls, fluorophenyl anilides, and fluorobenzamides—demonstrate good-to-high brain uptake in rodents and monkeys. No contradictory evidence or strong efflux liability is apparent, so the molecule is predicted to have meaningful CNS access.",
